# Requires the "REST Client" VS Code extension: click "Send Request" above each block.
# Run them from top to bottom. Later requests reuse the tokens from earlier ones.
# Registering twice fails with 409, so change the email (or run the seed logins only).

@gateway = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Register a new user
# @name register
POST {{gateway}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "newperson@example.test",
  "password": "password123",
  "name": "New Person",
  "birthday": "1999-03-14"
}

### 2. Log in as that user
# @name login
POST {{gateway}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "newperson@example.test",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 3. Create an organisation (the user becomes its admin; returns a new token)
# @name createOrg
POST {{gateway}}/api/orgs
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Chess Club",
  "timezone": "Europe/Budapest"
}

### 4. Current organisation (admins also see the invite code)
GET {{gateway}}/api/orgs/current
Authorization: Bearer {{createOrg.response.body.token}}

### 5. Log in as a seed member
# @name john
POST {{gateway}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "john@grace.test",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 6. John joins the new organisation with its invite code
# @name join
POST {{gateway}}/api/orgs/join
Authorization: Bearer {{john.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "inviteCode": "{{createOrg.response.body.organisation.inviteCode}}"
}

### 7. List members (should show the admin and John)
GET {{gateway}}/api/orgs/current/members
Authorization: Bearer {{createOrg.response.body.token}}

### 8. Who am I, and which organisations am I in?
GET {{gateway}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{join.response.body.token}}

### 9. Switch John back to Grace Church
POST {{gateway}}/api/auth/switch-org
Authorization: Bearer {{join.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orgId": "{{john.response.body.memberships[0].orgId}}"
}

### 10. Update my profile
PATCH {{gateway}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "showBirthday": false
}

### 11. Create a group (admin)
# @name group
POST {{gateway}}/api/orgs/current/groups
Authorization: Bearer {{createOrg.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Tournament team"
}

### 12. Mark myself unavailable
POST {{gateway}}/api/auth/me/unavailable
Authorization: Bearer {{createOrg.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "from": "2026-12-01",
  "to": "2026-12-14"
}

### 13. A wrong password should return 401
POST {{gateway}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "newperson@example.test",
  "password": "not-the-password"
}
